            <ArticleTitle>Acupuncture-induced pneumothorax: the hidden complication.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e11-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1177/0036933014565587</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acupuncture can be associated with potentially life-threatening complications. Although rare, we feel that potential complications are not being conveyed to patients. We present a case of acupuncture-induced pneumothorax and describe some changes to acupuncture practice that we would like to see implemented.</AbstractText>
